      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/morris-heights",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The High Bridge, New York City’s oldest surviving bridge, was restored and reopened to pedestrians in 2015, reconnecting the Bronx with Manhattan.",
